 Choose from a variety of ingredients and refine them with spices. Quality matters here too. The higher the quality and variety of your food, the higher the rank of your guests. Each guest has specific preferences, and more variations will increase their satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Weather</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160880/extras/dbd0e11b0b3952bf4526253105557228.poster.avif?t=1772702139\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160880/extras/dbd0e11b0b3952bf4526253105557228.webm?t=1772702139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160880/extras/dbd0e11b0b3952bf4526253105557228.mp4?t=1772702139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a dynamic world with stunning weather effects and a realistic day-night cycle. Whether it\u2019s bright sunshine, gentle rain, dense fog, or a roaring thunderstorm \u2013 the weather changes seamlessly and affects not only the mood but also the gameplay. Rain will drive citizens to seek refuge in the tavern, creating more mess, which impacts the cleanliness of your establishment.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160880/extras/f3b1405b81f0c2ba58b6b1fa75b6828a.avif?t=1772702139\" width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tavern Legends has a build in Twitch Integration with is available during the game in the options</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some implemented features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Viewers can visit your tavern</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get gold from bits and XP from subs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheers on follower, sub, bits and raids</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Viewers can start a poll and vote for freebeer and more</p></li></ul>","developers":["CROWFORGE Games"],"dlc":[3943020],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160880/cc0f47d968292df32828eff5dd1efe04c1550682/header.jpg?t=1772702139","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Tavern Legends \u00a92024 CROWFORGE Games. Published by CROWFORGE Games. Developed by CROWFORGE Games. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3160880/45654956/413d0144db9516b7a4d9d3f27b6ad397b4b4f50c/1750876396/dash_av1.mpd?t=1747577581","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3160880/45654956/413d0144db9516b7a4d9d3f27b6ad397b4b4f50c/1750876396/dash_h264.mpd?t=1747577581","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3160880/45654956/413d0144db9516b7a4d9d3f27b6ad397b4b4f50c/1750876396/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1747577581","id":257059021,"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257059021/b83820368df77e86c7ca1cce529ad82355287c6e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747577581"}],"name":"Tavern Legends","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Tavern Legends - $24.99 USD","packageid":1121790,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":2499}],"title":"Buy Tavern Legends"}],"packages":[1121790],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"